<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-10-21T18:48:20.119Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:48:20 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Father Patricio Alfredo Sánchez Molinari was killed when a wall-mounted crucifix fell on him during a livestreamed Mass in Guayaquil, Ecuador. Two days after the incident the church reinstalled the same cross, prompting his family to demand an inquiry and to allege that he had stolen $2 million from worshippers. Critics describe the episode as a leadership failure within the Ecuadorian Catholic hierarchy. The incident occurs amid Ecuador's ongoing security crisis that began in 2018 due to conflicts between criminal organizations linked to drug trafficking. The crisis recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxON0diRWtYOVBGX2ZQZVlER3ZTWkZjYmtYSFAydUs2eFQ1NzM2NWZNRFlSci13Slg1V1VPa1N1YTBUWGZWZG5IbDJkUzgzX3hONm9jUTh2Z1paUWNGOHBzUGhrcXE4UjNOblp4WDlVcVJZLWFqajVLT212WTBNM1F1VHRQSGdGQzhqNUVJbkw0c1Nkc0Vl?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQODBMY056RXdBUUhkeEpSUWZnN1Y4T2lTV3U0RnREeUVSV2taNzVwbjFjbFBYeFBNLXpsRGZlVUhzWHRzS3hyN1dkcnZWZHU5bHE4elJWNXhDV1ZEdmpXdDVRU2NfRnB5QXhZb3hkcmZrU3RqZFRYQ2s5al9XWVYzU1Rma1hCOTVyUHFMRzI2YTdqVGxFTmc4Zy1Zc2tHQzZTZWdzb2VFakhzakE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNWkJhby1YQmdVN1BOWmJoZjREZy04c05lWUM0OG91c0tycWNnYTF1QVdOQ0Y1eFVzUmpKT1p0RUJueWVkSGdHdDZMLVE1eE5lNnVTMlBBbXFoa3doc0s2d1dpV1ZXckc4NVJxMkJLRDg0N2ZiMFdrdzNQMERkX0NpWlNISl9ab3FYVlhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxObS1RRUc3Qmo5WHZhSTVhclVHMzdEVzYwNmphd19GNFVHcGd6UVlmU2tOTDZVdXA2Y0V4MjFPVXRLS0tXQ0ZqeVEtczAwV3dCTUVsVFo2UHVvSWpuVXNoT0k0VzNlcnNDZzg1WW50MXBIaUxnWURacHY2VFNQNFlmckJ3enh0UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://